{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_10008_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:02f8c2d93aa295e718fabb92f4920ef3a52266e130e5fe758de0eeac0a389134",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:60c9e6f2cad32a478310da65a7201e8c808089a58033603062beb58864f0b8f6",
      "text": "男子汉们的热血之战",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d842e607ad44a94a3bd2cb17da02de22054aef42a576d4dfa4f7d0f4f7ffa0c2",
      "text": "为了宣传以“连格斗家也为之沉迷的格斗游戏！”\n为宣传语的格斗游戏，THE 虎牙道定下出演活动。\n除了要表演负责的主题曲，组合内还要进行\n一场纪念表演赛……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_a:cmd-000020:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bd711a0c587f0c078d13f61396e0634340adf4afbcabad0ac20aea8f2b2a191",
      "text": "序章",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_a:cmd-000020:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:60c9e6f2cad32a478310da65a7201e8c808089a58033603062beb58864f0b8f6",
      "text": "男子汉们的热血之战",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_a:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:24676e338e5c3e7f4919e50c01086b4883419ed78cc9edb37042a0c3d0a44bea",
      "text": "什……在这里连击！？\n不行，下一击必须调整好架势……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_a:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:47ace305731515c09533aae3fce61dbb01824cbee6a01c8f3a833cfca340329c",
      "text": "库哈哈！全都是破绽啊，吃我这招！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_a:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1604ac82b475f13157394eaef650c493db1577c650933df1b8374b35c8032b19",
      "text": "呜……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_a:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7bc02773d79e30ad4d97188d32ed22dd1e7b2178bcf165055bacbe7180d38586",
      "text": "怎么样！小不点想赢本大爷，\n还早了100亿年呢，大笨蛋！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_a:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a41c727baad72e890585945c55af7aef889f1cff186372e68c795e7f624ed751",
      "text": "……我不擅长格斗游戏。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_a:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2acc6d6feab105357874e8c5f06c7f3b946f3663bad2208b6240fb652d6c9aa1",
      "text": "实际动手打要干脆得多……\n而且，实际打起来的话是我比较强。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_a:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:272135c5a3793a2ef70e864aef2b9f32bdb9e50211933447ef5a95313e49fc0d",
      "text": "啊啊！？丧家犬说什么都只是丧家犬而已啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_a:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cabea80e7f0a946305bebd83f895729ba201bcdb86e8b1dad20298fb86c075f6",
      "text": "活动当天本大爷也会把你打得落花流水，\n给我洗干净脖子等着吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_a:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f96da826c374b6513c1f92027fa541b05cee148f47731c5a2f79a814c0c627db",
      "text": "……没想到咱们居然会接到\n格斗游戏的工作啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_a:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f8caab4bd3d2a1e481dd61c9df9031f057f6ffc06327fb65ca7840188a587e7e",
      "text": "宣传语是“连格斗家也为之沉迷的\n格斗游戏”……对吧，师父。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_a:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0c0f9fb8f069eb0998f1f4eaf299890c6c743cbf53d916de861f6d0f28dcd690",
      "text": "是的！大家要在格斗游戏大赛的开场舞台上\n演唱主题曲。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_a:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4eeaf6e20d48b8d8838de859eb4dc03bc6268eb1a7a9e4b7756a7f7de2951934",
      "text": "之后还要通过纪念表演赛，\n决出THE 虎牙道的第一名，流程是这样的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_a:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:936d02409549eaf26ae45b5d41ba9be04520e760db215b657b8de64990d53704",
      "text": "两个人真就如宣传词一样完全沉迷进去了！\n不过，差不多到练习时间了哦。快收拾一下……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_a:cmd-000133:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:826e014bb7523d33aff398a29bc9c321987cb28e980e78baefb78035169f95e5",
      "text": "还没完，本大爷要把小不点再痛扁一顿！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_a:cmd-000140:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:65c72b9fd68715ef7383c8f014359adce4cf91107d3e644cb05e968047a9d73a",
      "text": "圆城寺先生。离练习不是还有一点时间吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_a:cmd-000151:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b50be4f8f14b25e468fc03f37019c9c2d120ee301f9f4ed4dc656a4d572547a",
      "text": "哎呀呀……真拿你们没办法。那就各再来一局啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_b:cmd-000011:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_b:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:82c32121d73acca745e464c454445c054d891ebcd1a5cd6fa10884bcc0b4456e",
      "text": "呼……晨练结束。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_b:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:79f6322c2ecfd91b3e66693f191e42628bbee061d92f08697e655cc4c24d6b6e",
      "text": "（刚开始当偶像的时候，\n真是摸不着头脑……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_b:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:690fa61d4a8fd7d24ca40b22089162862651b9818aff87ba3a3e46cb98113cc8",
      "text": "（但现在，已经一点点能够展现出\n像样的偶像演出了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_b:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:613dc36869622a01636a47e51505b0bb43b117d51517d644bd9e2c5ad71d1799",
      "text": "（而且，来看演出的人也变多了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_b:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7deebdc127bc8b3fa2f1a7c50dad83568faf0dd31e8cfa773abdebb70baad2ca",
      "text": "（这次开场舞台的练习也很顺利。\n但是……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_b:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:43463f6be27345db4a35b2bbf92914fdde2597fd771519d15fd080d7fdefcbc7",
      "text": "……玩游戏就是赢不了那家伙。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_b:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3d7cda8fefb9a9cf7c1399b79d20d0635ac252ce0379169b2ea6bbedb87bf1e0",
      "text": "那家伙明明说过自己是第一次碰游戏，\n技术却突飞猛进。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_b:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:035911701656e39a97d3178408b3ecbde5ec62d0b7efdcc7559875e4ff2bedfe",
      "text": "话说，每次在事务所看到他，\n他好像都在练习吧……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_b:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:515ce00a26dfe101523ad9efe20d3c145c59d43d7ef95e15a1ef966ce5b14edb",
      "text": "（差不多该提醒他，别老是一个人霸占电视和游戏机了。\n……不，但是……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_b:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f504ea6d5c90cf59b284b881e29f424a8b9a6d4ed246ff0856c16679e84d5847",
      "text": "（感觉他肯定会反呛一句：\n“你自己赢不了就急了是吧！”之类的……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_b:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:21da44e02c527517c59bd0b4584d90bc129409fcf82fcf0e082794cbeb251b52",
      "text": "……还是先在游戏里把他痛扁一顿再说吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_b:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bcc7dbc73f8030444a288877af0490273af63513d5590a2f791a503fc274b703",
      "text": "待会儿的练习，今天一定要给他好看。\n看招，“改·虎阵拳”！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_c:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eac40df4be944f2741096de016c6d3bc88c3bc3d09d33c2d45c37f80fd414420",
      "text": "辛苦了，●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_c:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:703c05c3dba47f63c3e640030b5bee94eace604a88dadf6bff9345e908872aa6",
      "text": "辛苦了，武先生。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_c:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:917586225f2a3e5275d14265de590c8491681c4487933d5698f3b585c69c148b",
      "text": "太慢了，小不点！赶紧准备好！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_c:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0b9dbc57c4e08601720ce06fd656d79db27743ed39d41567225a22e872f1ee34",
      "text": "别大喊大叫的。\n真是的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_c:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b2edeca2054d077db9d6905f7707c852ef60feb9ee98ccb2449a8a030299d1c3",
      "text": "今天也要把你痛扁一顿！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_c:cmd-000078:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2cf299b9db82240fc03c5e3aeca137dae387b6b9aadfc396c17215c632e680b3",
      "text": "数十分钟后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_c:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:979c4fc12c5ffe60bf03f7e7acf8a1c84f407914579cab7054eaa0ee972646b8",
      "text": "辛苦了！\n不好意思，上一份工作超时来晚了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_c:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:05210167db05150f707ef79de6fb67d3402385c06c91405e0761e00675deb90a",
      "text": "没关系的。\n工作辛苦了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_c:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b90cd831af25f47b47be81a78f012817abed3e13b13d202f597bcc5979341625",
      "text": "非常感谢！\n……哦，已经开打了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_c:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:504b9728ddebbc361e8552558fe6abb2aae7392766f131a00e94debf91824ccb",
      "text": "……唔。武的角色主要是拳击技能，\n涟是腿技，我则是投技。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_c:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f626c0f70efc1df2e3e0146b409e00b2299ad45b4c8afb4b33405a3208a8e6a5",
      "text": "如何应对对手的走位，\n就是这次对决的关键了呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_d:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d6ed85fbf6955f3727e5fb39e9beb081e34b7a5f0738a7bdcd715418cf497b10",
      "text": "喔啦喔啦！这局本大爷拿下了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_d:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2fffcf75192087b24a2dffbedc3986e4299fa932a2f761bf4ed159eb42df3ced",
      "text": "哈哈。涟这家伙，今天也很开心嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_d:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:907a3d0b912cc83bede2b7d9c6c2b7bd4ada0615feb25673204ad4ec80d41927",
      "text": "明明一开始还嫌麻烦，\n手柄一震动还吓了一跳呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_d:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b4e987312edf06627aab8d7c9c230583d589944ff671eaae7665efcb204b5af4",
      "text": "……不过，我也是第一次像这样和兄弟一样的存在\n一起打游戏，挺开心的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_d:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:384af4bec08c80bdfefb7138e3c2fd4e5d744c201ae4989abd163d811dd0a210",
      "text": "可恶，还没完！\n从这里反击……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_d:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5163062783af25e790379340fc8416c837dd3c39718d69f53840e19d8942d3b9",
      "text": "休想得逞！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_d:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bdb0b611cadb461849d55427258a17471c8444ce64ee44a47506b634fb19a6be",
      "text": "（不过……这两个人，进步真大啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_d:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a7b1c752b9c192a06808eab50bc4f08300f11919c43ffb597ab4362abbab55b6",
      "text": "（照这个势头，\n稍微不留神就要被追上了吧……？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_d:cmd-000135:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:92ae1638df94d77c753d732b2d11133682a31fc36d7209d827ee61063d133747",
      "text": "好耶，本大爷大获全胜！\n嘿嘿……能随便蹂躏小不点真是爽快。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_d:cmd-000139:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ce4619e5a166434bcab6602aa5a6a9caec934b54d4d6bf086cbbe74aa68aea65",
      "text": "喂，动作快点。下一个是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_d:cmd-000147:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7ab68cb6d4436491070615003db87636509dc57ffe9d8ddaf2fa8e7a5a3d3c5a",
      "text": "你够了。就你自己玩得起劲。\n圆城寺先生，既然来了就一起玩吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_d:cmd-000167:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f23f2182f4a27a5b4827f84894bd1f070003d1e83188c81372fd2041511b1cc2",
      "text": "哦，下一把轮到我了吗？\n我可不会输的，武！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_e:cmd-000020:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:35639546be8267f0d3e4d6b7675b6267a58b11ee0b871e886d5c2cbda0df14cb",
      "text": "格斗游戏大赛当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_e:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4be2acc436f259cf17e7b08c6218be72f624bbb20832b4ad5c4a5fe0e2446bdd",
      "text": "武先生、道流先生、涟先生。马上就要\n登台了，拜托各位了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_e:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:67645e84d05b1041c45f8089e78a66f709142becc4a92b4e90df4ba072060a49",
      "text": "好，知道了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_e:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f98f16d7f454fc0251fb8d208d1ab223d2a0ef326d7403c7770d6a7f08b27990",
      "text": "……大概因为这次是游戏活动吧，\n观众群和平时的演出不太一样呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_e:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ed95106dc34d707b1800ab0310329ba5b35980ab61391c97701b1d1826ede6f4",
      "text": "是啊。虽然也有平时的粉丝来，\n但应该有很多人原本对偶像不感兴趣吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_e:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:38f23ff9b1845890ddf3f080724c4b5fe8e7f8b0789528f65861e048560fec1a",
      "text": "面对这样的人，也要狠狠把\nTHE 虎牙道的魅力展现给他们看！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_e:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f975219c35f6b088544d81a7aead45fb8630cf3bd0e0c5ea4c32c9722adaf804",
      "text": "哼。管他来的是谁都无所谓。\n本大爷要让他们见识见识谁才是最强的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_e:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:290b9d96477bed6e6bc559562ac804b058ad25b5ecdcda76b1fbb5f842e5392f",
      "text": "THE 虎牙道的各位，请到舞台候场！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_e:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c24d3a26b29be2b0d6ed7148ebf5f214db7b999ba7aa40f992a341b5dbf769f",
      "text": "那么，●●●●プロデューサー。我们去了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_e:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f06813cabafd4b051c8c9c22e4ef4ba93bb7d8846e255ee190379cde8ccad7e",
      "text": "好的！祝你们顺利！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_f:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:418255d9f1acddf596d24362beb68e0e53c3834fd3610178e128a2ceb5c07c26",
      "text": "大家好！我们是THE 虎牙道！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_f:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1c937a7d161f14ddd5350614ac5fc656958b744930cc0950016c7e9d0cda6442",
      "text": "非常感谢大家邀请曾是格斗家的我们，\n来参加这次格斗游戏大赛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_f:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1506bd66919966c592f48e0770da9465739412d2c77ce901e0dbe1a54cb9c830",
      "text": "我们刚才也打了游戏，\n热血程度完全不输给现实中的比赛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_f:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a6e20750b3b1f4769e63d283b45b09ccd18c053be5ffd087ee1ab02635ea054",
      "text": "但是，在我们的舞台上，\n也一定会让在场的各位热血沸腾起来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_f:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a46df0a589c52957ec65f50ac062ffc534cc90ef310eff9f2d94073198d3f431",
      "text": "为了今天而精心打磨的表演，\n请各位睁大眼睛看好了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_f:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:702c62e189111aec180865aca6a47182c8f27ba0c26a53cd22e03b385628c4aa",
      "text": "（管他是游戏还是拳头，\n还是偶像，都无所谓！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_f:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7db9020fa579965ca6af17c487c8066916d775b3c90f57b184bf3e1516c4f7a3",
      "text": "（比起这里的任何人，本大爷都是最强、最顶尖的！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_f:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b0c67bd38c5dec7adb5e44186b7703f6450686fa0ac3253b37fca3a14b6d239",
      "text": "（武和涟的气势都很惊人啊。\n我也不能输给他们！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_f:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:38e03047c0b10b793ed119d82a97cbba041bb904e3bfae1484924527f61c5007",
      "text": "大家也尽管放马向我们冲过来吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_g:cmd-000014:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3e3c585049d6a6447759ab791a62bd37d2bf32ef1a7625d71233a37d714c24c8",
      "text": "纪念表演赛开始",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_g:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1f7b8b2a731c0bcd2a3be74571499216b61db77535c5005ab4d0cfaac2efa499",
      "text": "Ready……Fight！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_g:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:333df245f1226dab24f3e04d86f09d071daa558e63a483a7c5dde3e9085442a1",
      "text": "喔啦喔啦，看招！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_g:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:773f9eadb1ff2ca7c04ab47b24d3a102b89e8c620cf7b21eb5d15922b2faf196",
      "text": "好的，比赛开始了。THE 虎牙道带来的纪念表演赛！\n第一场是大河武VS牙崎涟！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_g:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4ccaf5bbb01c8484029efbab8515ca7bf77d5033d715cf2058d21bde3b9d977",
      "text": "哈，这种软绵绵的攻击怎么可能打得中！\n吃我这招！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_g:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1604ac82b475f13157394eaef650c493db1577c650933df1b8374b35c8032b19",
      "text": "呜……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_g:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f965b0ad14ce32ef3b65589bf756a7c871371c3613203c218d52d5141112611",
      "text": "牙崎选手的风格非常激进。\n华丽地打出了连击招式！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_g:cmd-000115:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ee57c179c41adc42ccf5bd1a8309a485b7541d95a31cfcf756dbddc8f10572a",
      "text": "库哈哈！差不多该死心……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_g:cmd-000131:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dab75226346ab5b2f49db2aeac36379d9c5d110053e6686f29d7426fbad28e27",
      "text": "就是现在！……“改·虎阵拳”！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_g:cmd-000154:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:acbad4e6846d077e799ac53c5a4cccc99ff075172f2c0236b9b11c8d54d7e572",
      "text": "什么！？你这家伙……！\n这种招式练习时一次都没……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_g:cmd-000164:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1bb1ceff34525f89d84037ce4b2956bbd4d2d76c8cd1721bc46fcb5719ac1905",
      "text": "可恶，休想得逞！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_g:cmd-000185:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9a6dc78d75bd1efd4280fbc0014b9c067a61a47719d66b4fec46aa6d555e93dc",
      "text": "哎呀，大河选手在这里扳回了一城！\n究竟这场比赛的结果会如何呢！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_h:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f85cf9b17490aa8f5ace5f1bf1f2c89eea41b5a963abb2f706e542e421c95a8e",
      "text": "唔唔……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_h:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e70c632710e2ddad2fbf3e106e1187c500881fa1a66515c8dfcf26a87fdbcfab",
      "text": "居然会是平局啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_h:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a1996574dcedfa060dbc9efd00b24cdac67c94bb043dcff3ce33b2040cdcb297",
      "text": "辛苦了，两位。\n哎呀，真是一场精彩的较量！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_h:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dff664136b601d07b09b111ee40646b2f5161fe7b29db69cfe43a363f5f296ac",
      "text": "吵死了！接下来轮到拉面店的了。\n准备好，这次我一定要拿下完全胜利！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_h:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fdc3eb37a9215be35159e2fef29966b04d0291695c6ed101f6bf54871b0daff7",
      "text": "我也不会输给圆城寺先生的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_h:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:578f2a32f830be62bffd32c3b559b4d19bd62dcc458cb9e7ab5f323e136b473f",
      "text": "哈哈，涟和武看起来都很棘手啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_h:cmd-000163:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f622848f789283f5c6c9e7e450a1ca91a212b24184c239d2ed2a69a7907600a0",
      "text": "对牙崎选手和大河选手打出漂亮的必杀技，\n夺得胜利的是……圆城寺选手！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_h:cmd-000169:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5c852713dfe77b98fa0274325c6a157a9f0c14ed3ef1e2b9632c92b6fb0ad606",
      "text": "本大爷居然会输给拉面店的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_h:cmd-000177:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c2abf2631bb7174e66ff4b10c9cf847a68ce76bd1a77cfdf49e61ad373383155",
      "text": "圆城寺先生原本就很强，\n是不是又变得更厉害了……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_h:cmd-000187:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c764a60b312fc7768c947f6ebe879fcdf5f2f9eae8a0505ad7c4c4aff1fe2d22",
      "text": "啊啊。如果是前阵子的我，\n说不定就会输给你们两个了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_i:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b254a0963184242d5b528e3288f3f043dcf97b955e31654d6aece9f48b6dbe9b",
      "text": "大赛的几天前……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_i:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1eefe75130ee1a4e43c4ba249d837a99b1832cf76ecb177dfab1189ba198a262",
      "text": "（呼，跑外勤总算结束了。\n接下来把要分给大家的资料整理一下……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_i:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ac62f713f57fd488760163259d980af99a634fe921356256f6bac3ce64d538a",
      "text": "咦？事务所亮着灯。\n这个时间还有人在吗……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_i:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c8ba81f44f7614066b0b187886bb0cb98d591a215a72cd61d15d96189c38a5d9",
      "text": "原来如此。\n投技只要在这个时机发动就行了吗……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_i:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:71b6520178d56d939a24025d7d9921388f98858583a58ee8dfdcc090dc3ad303",
      "text": "道流先生？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_i:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:51a73e6eba07297f8e575c52c555b2cbf81dc05af1fdd5b27a425b13c20ebe3d",
      "text": "啊，师、●●●●●●●●●●师父！\n那个，辛苦了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_i:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ab42530d7963ee5911f8b2074128d0089ba46a9361038b14483200d3519c54b",
      "text": "辛苦了。\n那个，今天不是舞蹈练习的日子吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_i:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:03db08be3f15c468604079018c9e91b8d69ed1fe87afcee1f4391c1e158a1099",
      "text": "啊——……是的，练习结束之后我才过来的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_i:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:75b05a44596baa3e4756621e49528b31626ff93c36721ca672423a4887925909",
      "text": "那个……武和涟进步都很快，\n我也忍不住觉得不想输给他们呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_i:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0de3d3de77050e99e16f47e5d438bfc2a1669a37daf9a3279f645d3201f2fc81",
      "text": "看着大赛视频和职业选手的解说，\n偷偷在自主练习……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_i:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9b993dfe7a7a0f5dfdaccb1e5254656d9ead83f5a589174704d12c9fdafd137d",
      "text": "啊！当然跳舞和唱歌，\n我也绝对没有偷工减料的意思！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_i:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9bf83dbb32f896015fec383dd8db42e2fd02bd3da9a7abaa387766affdf64c24",
      "text": "所以能不能再让我，\n多练一会儿游戏呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_i:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:904c543291034c0d8997a52ff4be5c5e0298e2cd93e16ff9f38a9c3050d4e4eb",
      "text": "原来是这么回事啊。\n请不要太勉强自己哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_i:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d7603954709a2d7f2d6a4e99690d1fbb0817dd909a9b9111913ecb34c982144",
      "text": "明白了！非常感谢您，\n●●●●●●●●●●师父！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_i:cmd-000115:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c7d8adc2c1f2921b7b65a0ec7c8da748abf3749f30a05dad2e27c23d3c8f0387",
      "text": "……喂喂，我是圆城寺。\n有件事想拜托您，所以联络了一下。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_i:cmd-000117:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6ffad1cf3e9b2c443fccd295bcba524b7e207585253bd8d1e65ba1719d1809ca",
      "text": "……我偷偷练习的事情，\n希望能对武和涟保密！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_i:cmd-000119:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c428c34a8bda10dae34890de27d3e10880de652e5a7880520f3491ba195c1d6",
      "text": "我明明一直跟他们两个人说，\n也要把精力放在演出上……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_i:cmd-000121:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:869253f5231468f4f33cec21f6b5632f4e79517d520d06c3b5f9037e80a4fa1e",
      "text": "结果自己却练游戏练到大半夜什么的，\n要是被知道了……那个～……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_i:cmd-000123:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2ca6f55f865f7693503d7a1bf6e13b4b7695315ee2baf62ee912493b6316aa89",
      "text": "明白了。\n我会保密的",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_i:cmd-000126:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b542926151ec2c7e833adc91b25ab33d841002f387af133d606ba070c41126e4",
      "text": "谢谢您，\n●●●●●●●●●●师父！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_i:cmd-000128:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:656eae4ae36f99701b803fa96c565c14bf4e236f0003e9c1f13984c1e266592b",
      "text": "当天的演出和纪念表演赛我都会全力以赴的，\n请好好看着我吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_i:cmd-000130:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:01a8cf646919c3430dcd7c9e3ee5aa552583c9d26f0c30d75cb8b58e5bc35ba7",
      "text": "那么，晚安啦。\n明天也请多多关照！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_j:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c791291f10a849f24e4a507942d6f1d9ac100c30c5508ade8f8de62fa053cd15",
      "text": "每一场对决都太精彩了！那么，\n让我们来听听获胜的圆城寺选手的感想吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_j:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:014592bbadf5d3d561de9c5033a55e2d1fbe3e90ed7e71749d335cd8bc8bf83a",
      "text": "圆城寺选手，您现在心情如何？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_j:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:913ad80ca7f41e7589c79d799265da10ec95f882a7a96c43036a8deb4ab105ea",
      "text": "涟和武都很棘手，对决非常尽兴。\n能勉强赢下来，都是自主练习的成果呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_j:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:92f69ef4d14fe45c13dad5e85c5238e42a4ce058a9acd56be07741da783ec9a5",
      "text": "自主练习……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_j:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a08ad93e32d60088aeaefd46f411827f12823f5e3804694b9082dfab537721cb",
      "text": "难不成圆城寺先生，\n在我们练习之外的时间也……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_j:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d6be4a940106da763c4309a1bb5d61c9cc877b2699a0cc98a85966adc8b17e74",
      "text": "你这家伙……居然背着本大爷，\n偷偷摸摸地练习吗！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_j:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:614bec19df6b568e66e53e87154b14598dd7891d3ec1733b4ce4b7d0c3c82caa",
      "text": "啊哈哈……抱歉！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_j:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:300d3d30448205e22e1421c88b3d53103197c3894e2d737558503f591fa55ebd",
      "text": "狡猾的拉面店！\n跟本大爷再打一局，立刻马上！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_j:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:857ca7125cd0b09c6bc8f49f909cf0e17a9555f094a9d27e351d97a18494afc0",
      "text": "哎呀，纪念表演赛已经\n分出胜负了嘛……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_j:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c330e2d3b9df86b332a412ed7af4e20f881b949b92a29383debffeb5ff4a5d4f",
      "text": "不过，非常欢迎三个人再一起玩哦。\n明天开始也在事务所一起打游戏吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_j:cmd-000116:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_j:cmd-000123:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7cfb08413aa54a674205b47b3ec863214862b370442eca0848dddcb410490ed1",
      "text": "虽然挺喜欢打游戏的，\n但没想到会变成工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_j:cmd-000125:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:56457cc4986a3e0f069323032e4462e881b0dab9b7ae845c7063babf7bf16d8c",
      "text": "演出和纪念表演赛\n都超级热烈啊",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_j:cmd-000127:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:84b7ca7d2f8c02f3d0eda4689f07a5d214212a11b69675af64e8d7a781508b61",
      "text": "是啊。看到自己的对决让\n观众沸腾起来时，让我想起了\n职业时期的比赛",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_j:cmd-000129:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d61157907a14e804d3479b16dbf9c8a07924056ad1376cee586c860691b83064",
      "text": "活动结束之后，\n解说员也称赞了\n我们的比赛呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_j:cmd-000131:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:84680b8d7281b5339f5c0e708852cbc13611c3fffe294abb277f50c4f13864f0",
      "text": "是一场很精彩的对决",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_j:cmd-000131:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bfc735aadb76dfc26e4ac1014def1bed69288e6e35128ae6f03775ce3c1968ff",
      "text": "是一场很精彩的对决！\n连我也忍不住热血沸腾起来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_j:cmd-000132:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0a4d2a13e4a9543a8921cf281ff1a591302da9193fa5464baba217ecd41e8e18",
      "text": "是一场最热血的对决",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_j:cmd-000132:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ac617b158f9959a96e30eea3cd64c1dd0eca7de8320f422a80ebb2950f4a8908",
      "text": "真不愧是THE 虎牙道！\n是一场最热血的对决。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_j:cmd-000136:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b542926151ec2c7e833adc91b25ab33d841002f387af133d606ba070c41126e4",
      "text": "谢谢您，\n●●●●●●●●●●师父！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_j:cmd-000138:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eb3e59d66f3cafbbd20cddf29f8157b57e229b0ea8dcd3cc62ac2e4137418d14",
      "text": "什么精彩的对决啊笨蛋",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_j:cmd-000140:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a20b423f339e7c1cb736e768fe08ee47a1b4c3436eb6cfc260bea1c72d1af860",
      "text": "下次绝对把你们揍趴下",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_j:cmd-000142:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f42ee7a89e60424eaa001f54f86d81a8a0c9877b75ea8b1c7d2b7adf8e998fa6",
      "text": "圆城寺先生，也跟我\n再打一场复仇赛吧",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_j:cmd-000144:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:85bab365dbcc3998664a84588fa4100bd618acfb957398b00d14541780ddb8a7",
      "text": "好啊，我随时奉陪！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_k:cmd-000020:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_k:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:37308b948afd651f05ed5adba5c06eb288a220384a14923d8da65a00158fd020",
      "text": "（在各大媒体上，纪念表演赛和\n现场表演都收获了极高的评价）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_k:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b7d5907728c7835e0aae7460e044d1626800f2368a3333c586d516225da9eb9",
      "text": "（感觉THE 虎牙道的粉丝群体，\n又得到了大幅拓展呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_k:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c4147fdc432896cfb84a16ea5c965ce8c1f0e35c3b387e6fe33452ef0a702537",
      "text": "可恶，这家伙……！\n怎么可能打得中啊！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_k:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b8451593b5a9b80777ea949e742c92049d4ac9ad6ffcaa8dce5c8904353daaa5",
      "text": "圆城寺先生果然厉害啊。\n跟我们的动作完全不是一个级别的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_k:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8dd5eae50fed3aca9094fb75fd77c01298e4d903c2800a35c8237948dc624004",
      "text": "武是不是也比以前进步了？\n好，下一把用这个角色……嗯？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_k:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:54daacb86f30159f40ebeba88468e1f0ffbe3199020978a9d8dd8eef7ccc73da",
      "text": "差不多该去练习了吧！\n你们两个，等回来再继续打吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_k:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc761eb5828524c102f38933aa3d822ed6d8b8202be1a28c5f29ef7348aac55a",
      "text": "嘁……\n你可别忘了啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_k:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:080ffb811ff9c9e5a69bbb807f689ab8d65779819ae4b3d9402068c122e7ced3",
      "text": "说起来，喜欢游戏的大吾先生和恭二先生，\n听说也看了大赛的转播呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_k:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef6492cd8fb95639766829adc32faa66a95d8dc3bf9820d325f68805afc071c8",
      "text": "两个人都说想和THE 虎牙道的各位\n切磋切磋呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_k:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:56e107f5fdc29af74316beeae449333543992d58888dc03355c5b8c434470c8c",
      "text": "喔喔，挺好的嘛。\n我不管谁来挑战都会赢给你们看的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_k:cmd-000119:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0da3fa3940c4ed243c2055e44093d4b45a5a55fec9643057af882ce0a94783f5",
      "text": "事务所的成员一起打游戏吗……挺让人期待的。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
